  'js-debug was not found. Download js-debug-dap from the vscode-js-debug releases page on GitHub, unpack it, and set the unpacked folder in Preferences, Language Servers, Run and Debug.': 'js-debug nije pronađen. Preuzmite js-debug-dap sa stranice izdanja vscode-js-debug na GitHub-u, raspakujte ga i postavite raspakovanu fasciklu u odeljku Postavke, Jezički serveri, Pokreni i otkloni greške.',
